### Test Availability Endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/api/availability
Accept: application/json

### Test Availability Endpoint (Alternative Port)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/availability
Accept: application/json

### Test Create Bowl (Regular)
POST http://localhost:3000/bowls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": "R",
  "base": "rice",
  "proteins": ["salmon"],
  "ingredients": ["cucumber", "avocado", "carrot"],
  "quantity": 1
}

### Test Create Bowl (Medium)
POST http://localhost:3000/bowls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": "M",
  "base": "black rice",
  "proteins": ["salmon", "tuna"],
  "ingredients": ["cucumber", "avocado", "carrot", "onion"],
  "quantity": 1
}

